---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-8 border-t border-line bg-ink">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <div class="mono text-faint">Company</div>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm leading-7 text-muted">
          AI-native operational intelligence software for complex, real-time, high-consequence systems.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="mono text-faint">Focus</div>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm leading-7 text-muted">
          Aviation, routing, geospatial systems, real-time decision infrastructure, and AI-assisted workflows.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="mono text-faint">Contact</div>
        <a class="mt-4 inline-block leading-7 text-body transition-colors hover:text-signal" href="mailto:danijel@cxromos.com">
          danijel@cxromos.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mono flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-line py-6 text-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <span>&copy; {year} CxRomos</span>
      <span>Built for decisions under pressure</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
